                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/martin-garrix-b2b-ed-sheeran-live-from-santiago-chile-2160p-4k.300242/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					<div style="text-align: center"><b><span style="font-size: 22px">MARTIN GARRIX B2B ED SHEERAN @ LIVE FROM SANTIAGO CHILE (2160p 4K)</span></b>​</div><br>
<img src="https://images2.imgbox.com/5f/0c/cXHL8UsM_o.jpg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://images2.imgbox.com/5f/0c/cXHL8UsM_o.jpg" style=""> <br>
<br>
The Martin Garrix B2B Ed Sheeran live performance was a monumental, surprise pop-up set filmed in Santiago, Chile, serving as a headline-making segment of a much larger global concert production. The high-energy performance, which features Ed Sheeran joining Garrix behind the DJ decks to drop unique, progressive-house mashups of his own hit songs, was integrated into the launch of Martin Garrix’s largest career headline tour. Taking place during the kickoff leg of his major 2026 Americas Tour, this specific 12-song B2B performance was designed to celebrate both Garrix's 30th birthday and the official release of their highly anticipated, 12-years-in-the-making collaboration single, "Repeat It".<br>
<br>
<img src="https://images2.imgbox.com/6f/9a/QJ54ae08_o.png" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://images2.imgbox.com/6f/9a/QJ54ae08_o.png" style=""> <br>
<br>
More information: <a href="https://martingarrix.com/tour/martin-garrix-americas-tour-05-15-2026/" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">https://martingarrix.com/tour/martin-garrix-americas-tour-05-15-2026/</a><br>
<br>




